{"id":"1a5df6cf30c97026","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-generalized-quantifier.md","title":"Generalized Quantifier","display":"df-generalized-quantifier — Generalized Quantifier","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-generalized-quantifier","aliases":["67-df-generalized-quantifier"],"display":"df-generalized-quantifier — Generalized Quantifier","depends_on":["[[67-df-isomorphism]]"],"source_scope":"historical-abstract-logic-material-not-located-in-this-book","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"source_search_scope":"provided PDF full text, contents and index; book 57 not re-audited","inherited_verification_status":"pending-source-outside-book","source_proof_status":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明","machine_verified":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-generalized-quantifier"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-generalized-quantifier</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-generalized-quantifier — Generalized Quantifier"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2aa449de50b1c012\" href=\"?note=2aa449de50b1c012\" title=\"67-df-isomorphism\">67-df-isomorphism</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"historical-abstract-logic-material-not-located-in-this-book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_search_scope","html":"provided PDF full text, contents and index; book 57 not re-audited"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"pending-source-outside-book"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec n=\\langle n_0,\\ldots,n_{m-1}\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^m\">\\(\\vec n=\\langle n_0,\\ldots,n_{m-1}\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\le m&lt;\\omega\">\\(1\\le m&lt;\\omega\\)</span>；单一元数接口中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 遍历非空集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q=(Q^A)_{A\\ne\\varnothing}\">\\(Q=(Q^A)_{A\\ne\\varnothing}\\)</span> 是候选广义量词族；元理论允许这种类指标族；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\mathrm{GenQuant}_{\\vec n}\">\\(Q\\in\\mathrm{GenQuant}_{\\vec n}\\)</span> 是类参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 上的元谓词记法，不断言所有此类参数组成一个集合。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:A\\to B\">\\(f:A\\to B\\)</span> 的双射条件由下式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Bij}\">\\(\\operatorname{Bij}\\)</span> 给出；本条不预先赋予载体任何额外结构。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^{(r)}\">\\(f^{(r)}\\)</span> 为下式的逐坐标函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r=0\">\\(r=0\\)</span> 时作用于唯一空元组。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GenQuant}_{\\vec n}\">\\(\\mathrm{GenQuant}_{\\vec n}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GenQuant}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{GenQuant}_n\\)</span> 在下式定义。单关系时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q^A(R)\">\\(Q^A(R)\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q^A(\\langle R\\rangle)\">\\(Q^A(\\langle R\\rangle)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Bij}(f,A,B)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow f:A\\to B\\land f[A]=B\\land\n\\forall a,a&#39;\\in A\\ (f(a)=f(a&#39;)\\Longrightarrow a=a&#39;),\\\\\nf^{(r)}(\\langle a_i\\rangle_{i&lt;r})&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle f(a_i)\\rangle_{i&lt;r},\\\\\nQ\\in\\mathrm{GenQuant}_{\\vec n}&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\left[\\forall A\\ne\\varnothing\\ \\left(Q^A:\\prod_{i&lt;m}\\mathcal P(A^{n_i})\\to\\{0,1\\}\\right)\\right]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall A,B\\ne\\varnothing\\forall f\\ \\left[\\operatorname{Bij}(f,A,B)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\vec R\\in\\prod_{i&lt;m}\\mathcal P(A^{n_i})\\\n\\left(Q^A(\\vec R)=Q^B(\\langle f^{(n_i)}[R_i]\\rangle_{i&lt;m})\\right)\\right],\\\\\n\\mathrm{GenQuant}_n&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{GenQuant}_{\\langle n\\rangle}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Bij}(f,A,B)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow f:A\\to B\\land f[A]=B\\land\n\\forall a,a&#39;\\in A\\ (f(a)=f(a&#39;)\\Longrightarrow a=a&#39;),\\\\\nf^{(r)}(\\langle a_i\\rangle_{i&lt;r})&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle f(a_i)\\rangle_{i&lt;r},\\\\\nQ\\in\\mathrm{GenQuant}_{\\vec n}&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\left[\\forall A\\ne\\varnothing\\ \\left(Q^A:\\prod_{i&lt;m}\\mathcal P(A^{n_i})\\to\\{0,1\\}\\right)\\right]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall A,B\\ne\\varnothing\\forall f\\ \\left[\\operatorname{Bij}(f,A,B)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\vec R\\in\\prod_{i&lt;m}\\mathcal P(A^{n_i})\\\n\\left(Q^A(\\vec R)=Q^B(\\langle f^{(n_i)}[R_i]\\rangle_{i&lt;m})\\right)\\right],\\\\\n\\mathrm{GenQuant}_n&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{GenQuant}_{\\langle n\\rangle}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>单一关系的旧接口保持为多关系接口的特例。载体没有附带签名时，所需不变性是所有双射下的不变性；不能使用未指定结构的“同构”。该语义条件本身不包含有效证明演算。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"2aa449de50b1c012","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-isomorphism]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\vec n=\\langle n_0,\\ldots,n_{m-1}\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^m","display":false},{"tex":"1\\le m<\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"Q=(Q^A)_{A\\ne\\varnothing}","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\in\\mathrm{GenQuant}_{\\vec n}","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"f:A\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Bij}","display":false},{"tex":"f^{(r)}","display":false},{"tex":"r=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GenQuant}_{\\vec n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GenQuant}_n","display":false},{"tex":"Q^A(R)","display":false},{"tex":"Q^A(\\langle R\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Bij}(f,A,B)&\\Longleftrightarrow f:A\\to B\\land f[A]=B\\land\n\\forall a,a'\\in A\\ (f(a)=f(a')\\Longrightarrow a=a'),\\\\\nf^{(r)}(\\langle a_i\\rangle_{i<r})&\\coloneqq\\langle f(a_i)\\rangle_{i<r},\\\\\nQ\\in\\mathrm{GenQuant}_{\\vec n}&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\left[\\forall A\\ne\\varnothing\\ \\left(Q^A:\\prod_{i<m}\\mathcal P(A^{n_i})\\to\\{0,1\\}\\right)\\right]\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall A,B\\ne\\varnothing\\forall f\\ \\left[\\operatorname{Bij}(f,A,B)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\vec R\\in\\prod_{i<m}\\mathcal P(A^{n_i})\\\n\\left(Q^A(\\vec R)=Q^B(\\langle f^{(n_i)}[R_i]\\rangle_{i<m})\\right)\\right],\\\\\n\\mathrm{GenQuant}_n&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{GenQuant}_{\\langle n\\rangle}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2444,"backlinks":[{"id":"336238f06be8e591","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a548cb5c1ed94888","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7fdea8f95f2861a9","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"eec586bbe9318717","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0485e18b7419ccd1","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-generalized-quantifier]]"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-36","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-generalized-quantifier]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-71","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-generalized-quantifier]]"}],"outgoing":["2aa449de50b1c012"]}